# OpenSPM M14 dev29 - Stop/deferred-cleanup verification
#
# Start this in a safe room, wait until NPCs visibly freeze, then press Stop.
# Expected: NPC freeze is removed and the capture is auto-saved.

defer npcs freeze off
defer npcs suspend off
defer speed 1

capture start stop-cleanup
npcs freeze on
speed 1.5
wait 30
capture stop
